  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2021 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Hair Thinning</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A clean, tinted mousse-gel for airy, feathery brows, boosted by hair care actives that condition and support full brow health.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Castor Oil: Nourishes hair for naturally lush, shiny brows.<br>- Panthenol Pro Vitamin B5: Helps revive brows.<br>- Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1: Supports healthier, fuller hair.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Get effortless fluffy, face-framing brows with just the right amount of volume from biodegradable, plant-based fibers, high-pigment yet natural tint, and strong yet flexible hold. The custom triangular spoolie boosts and lifts each hair.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Brush through brows to fluff and add volume. <br>-For extra boost, start by brushing backward from the tail end of your brows to the inner corner, then brush through brows like usual. <br><br>For full brow support: <br>Apply Brow Pop Clean Dual-Action Defining Eyebrow Pencil (sold separately) first, then layer on Air Brow Tinted Clean Volumizing Eyebrow Gel. You can also finish with Air Brow Clear + Clean Lifting Treatment Eyebrow Gel with Lamination Effect (sold separately) to complete the full Kosas brow look with peak tint, volume, and hold.<br><br><b>Clean at Sephora<br></b>Clean at Sephora is formulated without a list of over 50 ingredients, including sulfates (SLS and SLES), parabens, phthalates, and more. For the full list, check out the Ingredients tab.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Castor Oil: Nourishes hair for naturally lush, shiny brows.<br>-Panthenol Pro Vitamin B5: Helps revive brows.<br>-Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1: Supports healthier, fuller hair.<br><br>Aqua, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Pullulan, Stearic Acid, Cetyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Oleic/Linoleic/Linolenic Polyglycerides, Sorbitol, Glyceryl Oleate, Silica, Mica, Panthenol, Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Tocopherol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Foeniculum Vulgare (Fennel) Fruit Oil, Trehalose, Acacia Senegal Gum, Polylactic Acid, Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Hydroxide, Phenethyl Alcohol, Pentylene Glycol, Propanediol, Tin Oxide [+/ -: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxide (CI 77492), Iron Oxide (CI 77491), Iron Oxide (CI 77499)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
